# ============================================================
# This repository lives INSIDE the Red Alert 2 game directory.
# Default-deny everything at the root, then whitelist project
# entries only - this guarantees no game assets (*.mix, *.exe,
# *.dll, *.bik, ...) can ever be tracked, regardless of name.
# ============================================================

/*
# Project files & folders
!/.gitignore
!/.gitmodules
!/README.md
!/CMakeLists.txt
!/injector.cpp
!/PROJECT/
!/src/
!/include/
!/scripts/
!/third_party/

# Build outputs
build/
bin/
out/
*.obj
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.idb
*.log
.vs/
.vscode/

# Game binaries & dependencies (defense in depth)
*.mix
*.MIX
*.mmx
*.MMX
*.yro
*.YRO
*.bik
*.BIK
*.exe
*.EXE
*.dll
*.DLL
*.csf
*.CSF
*.map
*.mpr
*.yrm
*.pkt
*.vqp
*.tmp
*.ini
*.INI
*.dat
*.shp
*.fnt
*.tlb
*.lcf
*.sys
